{
  "name": "WordPress Broken Link Monitor with Telegram Alerts",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "66a0dab1-9cab-4cd1-b2f3-529cf2e40868",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1136,
        -192
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 720,
        "content": "## WordPress Broken Link Monitor with Telegram Alerts\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow runs on a weekly schedule to monitor a WordPress site's sitemap for broken post URLs. It reads the configured website URL, fetches and parses the WordPress sitemap, checks each post URL, then filters failed responses. Any broken links are collected into a Telegram alert for the configured chat.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Set the desired schedule in the Weekly Schedule trigger.\n- Update Website Configuration with the WordPress websiteUrl and telegramChatId values.\n- Configure Telegram credentials with a bot token that can send messages to the target chat.\n- Ensure the WordPress site exposes its sitemap at /wp-sitemap.xml and that n8n can access the site URLs.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can adjust the sitemap path, the status-code rules in Is Link Broken?, the fields captured in Prepare Error Details, and the Telegram alert message format."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "8421b3c4-a80e-4622-8a3f-e830913894c0",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -576,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 416,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Schedule and configuration\n\nStarts the workflow on a weekly cadence and defines the website URL and Telegram chat settings used by later nodes."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5cb0e8-a75a-49b9-8f3a-de77099662c1",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -128,
        -128
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Fetch sitemap URLs\n\nRetrieves the WordPress sitemap index and post sitemap, parses the XML, and splits the sitemap entries into individual post URLs for checking."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5ff862de-95cf-4fcc-b2c8-0686c46d86de",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        544,
        -192
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 496,
        "height": 352,
        "content": "## Check broken links\n\nRequests each post URL, evaluates whether the response indicates a broken link, and prepares structured error details for failed URLs."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20a31ebf-ddf6-442e-a793-791691ea71eb",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -464,
        224
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Aggregate and alert\n\nCollects all broken-link records into a summary and sends the result to Telegram as an alert."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "917294d5-8120-4dff-bdb4-7eb70cc07841",
      "name": "Weekly Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        -528,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.4
    },
    {
